      "side": 1,
      "message": "Minute-IA is the name of core. I added MIA since it\u0027s MIA specific.\nIf we don\u0027t specify MIA and just use TASK_FLAG_USE_FPU, then it looks the flag is for common for all cores.\nBy having MIA prefix. the value 0x00000001 is assigned for FPU in MIA. Other cores which need per-task flags can assign the same value(0x00000001) for its own purpose.",
